  "colorfulpipes.display_source.boiler_status": "Boiler Status",
  "colorfulpipes.ponder.cogwheel_casing.header": "Encasing Cogwheels",
  "colorfulpipes.ponder.cogwheel_casing.text_1": "Copper or Colored Casing can be used to decorate Cogwheels",
  "colorfulpipes.ponder.cogwheel_casing.text_2": "Components added after encasing will not connect to the shaft outputs",
  "colorfulpipes.ponder.cogwheel_casing.text_3": "The Wrench can be used to toggle connections",
  "colorfulpipes.ponder.encased_fluid_pipe.header": "Encasing Fluid Pipes",
  "colorfulpipes.ponder.encased_fluid_pipe.text_1": "Copper Casing can be used to decorate Fluid Pipes",
  "colorfulpipes.ponder.encased_fluid_pipe.text_2": "Aside from being concealed, Encased Pipes are locked into their connectivity state",
  "colorfulpipes.ponder.encased_fluid_pipe.text_3": "It will no longer react to any neighbouring blocks being added or removed",
  "colorfulpipes.ponder.fluid_pipe_flow.header": "Moving Fluids using Copper Pipes",
  "colorfulpipes.ponder.fluid_pipe_flow.text_1": "Fluid Pipes can connect two or more fluid sources and targets",
  "colorfulpipes.ponder.fluid_pipe_flow.text_2": "Using a wrench, a straight pipe segment can be given a window",
  "colorfulpipes.ponder.fluid_pipe_flow.text_3": "Windowed pipes will not connect to any other adjacent pipe segments",
  "colorfulpipes.ponder.fluid_pipe_flow.text_4": "Powered by Mechanical Pumps, the Pipes can transport Fluids",
  "colorfulpipes.ponder.fluid_pipe_flow.text_5": "No fluid is being extracted at first",
  "colorfulpipes.ponder.fluid_pipe_flow.text_6": "Once the flow connects them, the endpoints gradually transfer their contents",
  "colorfulpipes.ponder.fluid_pipe_flow.text_7": "Thus, the Pipe blocks themselves never 'physically' contain any fluid",
  "colorfulpipes.ponder.fluid_pipe_interaction.header": "Draining and Filling fluid containers",
  "colorfulpipes.ponder.fluid_pipe_interaction.text_1": "Endpoints of a pipe network can interact with a variety of blocks",
  "colorfulpipes.ponder.fluid_pipe_interaction.text_2": "Any block with fluid storage capabilities can be filled or drained",
  "colorfulpipes.ponder.fluid_pipe_interaction.text_3": "Source blocks right in front of an open end can be picked up...",
  "colorfulpipes.ponder.fluid_pipe_interaction.text_4": "...while spilling into empty spaces can create fluid sources",
  "colorfulpipes.ponder.fluid_pipe_interaction.text_5": "Pipes can also extract fluids from a handful of other blocks directly",
  "colorfulpipes.ponder.fluid_tank_sizes.header": "Dimensions of a Fluid tank",
  "colorfulpipes.ponder.fluid_tank_sizes.text_1": "Fluid Tanks can be combined to increase the total capacity",
  "colorfulpipes.ponder.fluid_tank_sizes.text_2": "Their base square can be up to 3 blocks wide...",
  "colorfulpipes.ponder.fluid_tank_sizes.text_3": "...and grow in height by more than 30 additional layers",
  "colorfulpipes.ponder.fluid_tank_sizes.text_4": "Using a Wrench, a tanks' window can be toggled",
  "colorfulpipes.ponder.fluid_tank_storage.header": "Storing Fluids in Fluid Tanks",
  "colorfulpipes.ponder.fluid_tank_storage.text_1": "Fluid Tanks can be used to store large amounts of fluid",
  "colorfulpipes.ponder.fluid_tank_storage.text_2": "Pipe networks can push and pull fluids from any side",
  "colorfulpipes.ponder.fluid_tank_storage.text_3": "The contained fluid can be measured by a Comparator",
  "colorfulpipes.ponder.fluid_tank_storage.text_4": "However, in Survival Mode Fluids cannot be added or taken manually",
  "colorfulpipes.ponder.fluid_tank_storage.text_5": "You can use Basins, Item Drains and Spouts to drain or fill fluid containing items",
  "colorfulpipes.ponder.hose_pulley.header": "Source Filling and Draining using Hose Pulleys",
  "colorfulpipes.ponder.hose_pulley.text_1": "Hose Pulleys can be used to fill or drain large bodies of Fluid",
  "colorfulpipes.ponder.hose_pulley.text_2": "With the Kinetic Input, the height of the pulleys' hose can be controlled",
  "colorfulpipes.ponder.hose_pulley.text_3": "The Pulley retracts while the input rotation is inverted",
  "colorfulpipes.ponder.hose_pulley.text_4": "On the opposite side, pipes can be connected",
  "colorfulpipes.ponder.hose_pulley.text_5": "Attached pipe networks can either provide fluid to the hose...",
  "colorfulpipes.ponder.hose_pulley.text_6": "...or pull from it, draining the pool instead",
  "colorfulpipes.ponder.hose_pulley.text_7": "Fill and Drain speed of the pulley depends entirely on the fluid networks' throughput",
  "colorfulpipes.ponder.hose_pulley_infinite.header": "Passively Filling and Draining large bodies of Fluid",
  "colorfulpipes.ponder.hose_pulley_infinite.text_1": "When deploying the Hose Pulley into a large enough ocean...",
  "colorfulpipes.ponder.hose_pulley_infinite.text_2": "It will provide/dispose fluids without affecting the source",
  "colorfulpipes.ponder.hose_pulley_infinite.text_3": "Pipe networks can limitlessly take fluids from/to such pulleys",
  "colorfulpipes.ponder.hose_pulley_level.header": "Fill and Drain level of Hose Pulleys",
  "colorfulpipes.ponder.hose_pulley_level.text_1": "While fully retracted, the Hose Pulley cannot operate",
  "colorfulpipes.ponder.hose_pulley_level.text_2": "Draining runs from top to bottom",
  "colorfulpipes.ponder.hose_pulley_level.text_3": "The surface level will end up just below where the hose ends",
  "colorfulpipes.ponder.hose_pulley_level.text_4": "Filling runs from bottom to top",
  "colorfulpipes.ponder.hose_pulley_level.text_5": "The filled pool will not grow beyond the layer above the hose end",
  "colorfulpipes.ponder.item_drain.header": "Emptying Fluid Containers using Item Drains",
  "colorfulpipes.ponder.item_drain.text_1": "Item Drains can extract fluids from items",
  "colorfulpipes.ponder.item_drain.text_2": "Right-click it to pour fluids from your held item into it",
  "colorfulpipes.ponder.item_drain.text_3": "When items are inserted from the side...",
  "colorfulpipes.ponder.item_drain.text_4": "...they roll across, emptying out their contained fluid",
  "colorfulpipes.ponder.item_drain.text_5": "Pipe Networks can now pull the fluid from the drains' internal buffer",
  "colorfulpipes.ponder.mechanical_pump_flow.header": "Fluid Transportation using Mechanical Pumps",
  "colorfulpipes.ponder.mechanical_pump_flow.text_1": "Mechanical Pumps govern the flow of their attached pipe networks",
  "colorfulpipes.ponder.mechanical_pump_flow.text_2": "Their arrow indicates the direction of flow",
  "colorfulpipes.ponder.mechanical_pump_flow.text_3": "The network behind is now pulling fluids...",
  "colorfulpipes.ponder.mechanical_pump_flow.text_4": "...while the network in front is transferring it outward",
  "colorfulpipes.ponder.mechanical_pump_flow.text_5": "The pumps direction is unaffected by the input rotation",
  "colorfulpipes.ponder.mechanical_pump_flow.text_6": "Instead, a Wrench can be used to reverse the direction",
  "colorfulpipes.ponder.mechanical_pump_speed.header": "Throughput of Mechanical Pumps",
  "colorfulpipes.ponder.mechanical_pump_speed.text_1": "Regardless of speed, Mechanical Pumps affect pipes connected up to 16 blocks away",
  "colorfulpipes.ponder.mechanical_pump_speed.text_2": "Speeding up the input rotation changes the speed of flow propagation...",
  "colorfulpipes.ponder.mechanical_pump_speed.text_3": "...and the speed at which fluids are transferred",
  "colorfulpipes.ponder.mechanical_pump_speed.text_4": "Pumps can combine their throughputs within shared pipe networks",
  "colorfulpipes.ponder.mechanical_pump_speed.text_5": "Ensure that all of them are facing in the same direction",
  "colorfulpipes.ponder.portable_fluid_interface.header": "Contraption Fluid Exchange",
  "colorfulpipes.ponder.portable_fluid_interface.text_1": "Fluid Tanks on moving contraptions cannot be accessed by any pipes",
  "colorfulpipes.ponder.portable_fluid_interface.text_2": "This component can interact with fluid tanks without the need to stop the contraption",
  "colorfulpipes.ponder.portable_fluid_interface.text_3": "Place a second one with a gap of 1 or 2 blocks inbetween",
  "colorfulpipes.ponder.portable_fluid_interface.text_4": "Whenever they pass by each other, they will engage in a connection",
  "colorfulpipes.ponder.portable_fluid_interface.text_5": "While engaged, the stationary interface will represent ALL Tanks on the contraption",
  "colorfulpipes.ponder.portable_fluid_interface.text_6": "Fluid can now be inserted...",
  "colorfulpipes.ponder.portable_fluid_interface.text_7": "...or extracted from the contraption",
  "colorfulpipes.ponder.portable_fluid_interface.text_8": "After no contents have been exchanged for a while, the contraption will continue on its way",
  "colorfulpipes.ponder.portable_storage_interface_redstone.header": "Redstone Control",
  "colorfulpipes.ponder.portable_storage_interface_redstone.text_1": "Redstone power will prevent the stationary interface from engaging",
  "colorfulpipes.ponder.shaft_casing.header": "Encasing Shafts",
  "colorfulpipes.ponder.shaft_casing.text_1": "copper or glass Casing can be used to decorate Shafts",
  "colorfulpipes.ponder.smart_pipe.header": "Controlling Fluid flow using Smart Pipes",
  "colorfulpipes.ponder.smart_pipe.text_1": "Smart pipes can help control flows by fluid type",
  "colorfulpipes.ponder.smart_pipe.text_2": "When placed directly at the source, they can specify the type of fluid to extract",
  "colorfulpipes.ponder.smart_pipe.text_3": "Simply Right-Click their filter slot with any item containing the desired fluid",
  "colorfulpipes.ponder.smart_pipe.text_4": "When placed further down a pipe network, smart pipes will only let matching fluids continue",
  "colorfulpipes.ponder.spout_filling.header": "Filling Items using a Spout",
  "colorfulpipes.ponder.spout_filling.text_1": "The Spout can fill fluid holding items provided beneath it",
  "colorfulpipes.ponder.spout_filling.text_2": "The content of a Spout cannot be accessed manually",
  "colorfulpipes.ponder.spout_filling.text_3": "Instead, Pipes can be used to supply it with fluids",
  "colorfulpipes.ponder.spout_filling.text_4": "The Input items can be placed on a Depot under the Spout",
  "colorfulpipes.ponder.spout_filling.text_5": "When items are provided on a belt...",
  "colorfulpipes.ponder.spout_filling.text_6": "The Spout will hold and process them automatically",
  "colorfulpipes.ponder.steam_whistle.header": "Setting up Steam Whistles",
  "colorfulpipes.ponder.steam_whistle.text_1": "Steam Whistles can be placed on a Fluid Tank",
  "colorfulpipes.ponder.steam_whistle.text_2": "If the tank receives sufficient heat...",
  "colorfulpipes.ponder.steam_whistle.text_3": "...the Whistle will play a note when activated",
  "colorfulpipes.ponder.steam_whistle.text_4": "Use a Whistle item on the block to lower its pitch",
  "colorfulpipes.ponder.steam_whistle.text_5": "Cycle between three different octaves using a Wrench",
  "colorfulpipes.ponder.steam_whistle.text_6": "Engineer's Goggles can help to find out the current pitch of a Whistle",
  "colorfulpipes.ponder.table_cloth.header": "Selling items with Table Cloths",
  "colorfulpipes.ponder.table_cloth.text_1": "Table cloths can be used to display items",
  "colorfulpipes.ponder.table_cloth.text_10": "When checking out at the cashier, the bought items will be placed into a package",
  "colorfulpipes.ponder.table_cloth.text_11": "From there, they can be transported to the shop front",
  "colorfulpipes.ponder.table_cloth.text_12": "The payments will be stored inside the stock ticker block",
  "colorfulpipes.ponder.table_cloth.text_2": "With the help of a logistics system, they can also be used to sell items",
  "colorfulpipes.ponder.table_cloth.text_3": "Start with the shop's inventory, a Packager and Stock link",
  "colorfulpipes.ponder.table_cloth.text_4": "Bind a Stock ticker to the link and place it in the shop",
  "colorfulpipes.ponder.table_cloth.text_5": "Employ a mob or blaze burner as the shop keeper",
  "colorfulpipes.ponder.table_cloth.text_6": "Fill the shop inventory with items to be sold",
